  "description": "\"Change of use from Office, retail, restaurant and private medical (Use Class E) to flexible Retail and Cultural (Use Class E/F1) and Hotel (Use Class C1) with ancillary bar, cafe and restaurant on part ground, lower ground, basement and upper floors (285 rooms); at 15-17 Eldon Street, demolition of 5th floor level and a replacement 5th floor level, additional 6th, 7th and 8th floor levels and rear partial infill extension from second to fourth floors to provide hotel accommodation; at 6 Broad Street Place, rear partial infill extension from first to fifth floors, removal of existing rooftop plant enclosure and erection of one storey roof extension at seventh floor; creation of new shopfronts and new hotel entrance at ground floor level; installation of plant equipment, louvred enclosures, stair enclosure, green roof and solar photovoltaic panels at roof level; provision of cycle parking spaces and shower/changing facilities at basement levels, resurfacing and refurbishment of passageway; provision of ancillary hotel facilities and all other works associated.” ",
